T* (fast feedback.) Tj
T* (            4. Work in Process \(WIP\): Efficiently manage WIP with sensible batch sizes and) Tj
T* (consider the cost of delay.) Tj
T* (            5. Progress Measurement: Measure progress by the delivery of validated assets rather) Tj
